        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-03T18:54:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "operateX and operateY had been static functions that accepted a Builder, which is why Builder had to be a public forward declaration. Making them private members of the Builder being operated on lets us hide Builder\u0027s declaration.",
